THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL — CWaPE REGULATORY FORMS
=============================================

The files matching the following pattern are NOT OptimCE-authored content and
are NOT covered by the Apache-2.0 grant in LICENSE:

    document-templates/administrative-document/<doc_type>/v<n>/template.pdf
    document-templates/administrative-document/<doc_type>/v<n>/template.xlsx
    document-templates/administrative-document/<doc_type>/v<n>/template.docx

They are the official, blank administrative forms published by the Commission
wallonne pour l'Énergie (CWaPE), the Walloon energy regulator, and are
redistributed here unmodified. They are included because the service's purpose
is to file the regulator's own document rather than a reproduction of it: the
rendering step sets AcroForm field values, spreadsheet cell values, or replaces
the "[à compléter]" markers of a Word convention, and changes nothing else.

Each bundle's manifest.json records the exact publication it wraps in its
"_source" key, for example:

    "CWaPE document 5617 — Formulaire de notification CE, Annexe 6,
     format of 2026-02-25. Unmodified: only cell values are written."

Rights in these documents remain with CWaPE. Their inclusion here is not a
sublicence, and OptimCE makes no representation about your right to use,
reproduce, or redistribute them. If you fork or redistribute this repository,
satisfy yourself as to the terms that apply to them — or obtain them directly
from the regulator.

What IS OptimCE's own work in that directory, and IS covered by the Apache-2.0
grant: every manifest.json (the field and cell bindings, the JSON Schema over
the input data, the declared capacities) and document-templates/README.md.

CWaPE publications: https://www.cwape.be
